                                    <span class="plan">Deluxe Room</span>
                                    <h3 class="price">$129/<span class="time">Night</span></h3>
                                    <p>Perfect for solo travelers or couples seeking elegant comfort.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="pricing-body">
                                    <ul class="check-list style-one">
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Queen-size bed</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Smart room control</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Free Wi-Fi</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Complimentary breakfast</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Daily housekeeping</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Air conditioning</li>
